[Sign Up](https://www.realestateindia.com/registration.php \"Sign Up\")\n\n* Profile\n* My Dashboard\n* My Enquiry\n* Post Property\n* My Property\n* [Property Leads New](https://www.realestateindia.com/property-lead \"Property Leads\")\n* Post Requirement\n* [Advertise with us](https://www.realestateindia.com/advertise/ \"Advertise with us\")\n* Search by Property ID\n* [Download App](https://www.realestateindia.com/download-mobile-apps.htm \"Download Mobile App\")\n\n* [Home](https://www.realestateindia.com/mumbai-property/ \"Home\")\n* [Residential Projects in Mumbai](https://www.realestateindia.com/mumbai-property/residential-projects.htm \"Residential Projects in Mumbai\")\n* [Residential Projects in Kandivali West Mumbai](https://www.realestateindia.com/mumbai-property/residential-projects-in-kandivali-west.htm \"Residential Projects in Kandivali West, Mumbai\")\n* Ravi Gaurav Garden I in Kandivali West Mumbai\n\n![Ravi Gaurav Garden I, Mumbai - Ravi Gaurav Garden I](https://dynamic.realestateindia.com/proj_images/wh4/project19199/proj_header_image-19199.jpeg)\n\n# Ravi Gaurav Garden I\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n1, 3 BHK Flats / Apartments\n\n* [Overview](#pdOverview)\n* [Unit Configuration](#pdPriceRange)\n* [Amenities](#pdAminities)\n* [Gallery](#projectGallery)\n* [Location Map](#pdLocationMap)\n* [About Builder](#pdAboutBuilderProject)\n\nRavi Gaurav Garden I Flats / Apartments\n\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img1.jpg)\n\n  Property Type  \n\n  Flats / Apartments\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img2.jpg)\n\n  Configuration  \n\n  1, 3 BHK\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img13.jpg)\n\n  Area of Flats / Apartments  \n\n  635 Sq.ft.\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img4.jpg)\n\n  Possession  \n\n  Jun 2009\n* ![](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/pf-img9.jpg)\n\n  Possession Status  \n\n  Ready to Move\n\n## Unit Configuration\n\n| Unit Type | Area | Price (in ) | Floor Plan |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | 635 Sq.ft. (Built Up) | Call for Price |  |\n\n## About Ravi Gaurav Garden I\n\nRavi Gaurav Garden I by Ravi Group at Kandivali West, Mumbai. It offers 2 and 3 BHK residential apartments area ranging sq.ft. with price per sq.ft. from -. The project offers world class residential [...read more](javascript:void(0);)\n\n### About Ravi Gaurav Garden I\n\nAbout Ravi Gaurav Garden I\n\nRavi Gaurav Garden I by Ravi Group at Kandivali West, Mumbai. It offers 2 and 3 BHK residential apartments area ranging sq.ft. with price per sq.ft. from -. The project offers world class residential units with top line specifications. The project enables easy connectivity to all points of interest in and around city.  \n  \nRavi Gaurav Garden I apartments are located at an excellent locality of Kandivali West, Mumbai. which is much far from the hasty tones and fuzziness of the city. With bizarre hi-tech specifications of quality construction and architectural designs, you can be sure of loving the place where you would see your bright future.  \n  \nThe facilities provided are top of the line matching your desire for a perfect home as Land scaped Garden, Play Area, Maintenance Staff, Security and Intercom which invite you to discover an exquisitely sublime world of refined indulgences for the rare few who have carved their own niche in the upper echelons of society.\n\n## Amenities\n\n* ![Club House](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/club-house.jpg)\n\n  Club House\n* ![Gymnasium](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/gymnasium.jpg)\n\n  Gymnasium\n* ![Intercom](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/intercom.jpg)\n\n  Intercom\n* ![Jogging and Strolling Tracks](https://static.realestateindia.com/rei/mobile-images/aminities/jogging-strolling-tracks.jpg)\n\n  Jogging and Strolling Tracks\n* ![Kids Play Area](https: