"Projects in Hyderabad\")\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.magicbricks.com/garden-grove-borivali-west-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235303437353039","title":"Garden Grove in Borivali West, Mumbai: Price, Brochure, Floor Plan, Reviews","raw_content":"![image of Garden Grove](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h470_w1080/Photo_h310_w462/Project-Photo-18-Garden-Grove-Mumbai-5047509_488_1366_310_462_470_1080.jpg \"image of Garden Grove\")\n![image of Garden Grove](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h470_w1080/Photo_h310_w462/Project-Photo-10-Garden-Grove-Mumbai-5047509_972_1296_310_462_470_1080.JPEG \"image of Garden Grove\")\n![image of Garden Grove](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h470_w1080/Photo_h310_w462/Project-Photo-7-Garden-Grove-Mumbai-5047509_972_1296_310_462_470_1080.JPEG \"image of Garden Grove\")\n![image of Garden Grove](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h470_w1080/Photo_h310_w462/Project-Photo-4-Garden-Grove-Mumbai-5047509_972_1296_310_462_470_1080.JPEG \"image of Garden Grove\")\n![image of Garden Grove](https://img.staticmb.com/mbimages/project/Photo_h470_w1080/Photo_h310_w462/Project-Photo-1-Garden-Grove-Mumbai-5047509_972_1296_310_462_470_1080.JPEG \"image of Garden Grove\")\n\n# Garden Grove Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n## By Kamla Landmarc Group\n\n## Properties in Garden Grove\n\n![Garden Grove 1 BHK Flat 511 sq.ft](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Garden Grove 1 BHK Flat 511 sq.ft\")\n\n## About Garden Grove Mumbai\n\n## Garden Grove Mumbai Top Amenities\n\n|  |  |\n| --- | --- |\n| Garden Grove Price | Rs. 2.0 Cr - 2.53 Cr |\n| Garden Grove Status | Ready To Move |\n| Garden Grove Launch Date | 01 March 2007 |\n| Garden Grove Possession Date | 01 October 2010 |\n| Towers in Garden Grove | 6 |\n\n### How is the Borivali West Real Estate Market?\n\n## Ratings & Reviews for Borivali West\n\n![map image](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"map image\")\n\n## Landmarks near Garden Grove\n\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n![Top Match Logo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Top Match Logo\")\n![Nicco Vanashri](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Nicco Vanashri\")\n![Ruparel Zinnia](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ruparel Zinnia\")\n\n## Price Trend for Garden Grove Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n| Project vs Locality Price | Apr-June'26 | Jan-Mar'26 | Oct-Dec'25 | Jul-Sept'25 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Garden Grove | ₹ 24859 / sq.ft | ₹ 24859 / sq.ft | ₹ 24859 / sq.ft | ₹ 24859 / sq.ft |\n| Borivali West | ₹ 25003 / sq.ft3% | ₹ 24363 / sq.ft2% | ₹ 23914 / sq.ft-1% | ₹ 24273 / sq.ft-4% |\n\n## Garden Grove Photos & Videos\n\n![Garden Grove photos 1](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Garden Grove photos 1\")\n![Project Entrance in Garden Grove](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Garden Grove\")\n![Project Entrance in Garden Grove](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Garden Grove\")\n![View from Gate in Garden Grove](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"View from Gate in Garden Grove\")\n![Commercial Building in Garden Grove](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Commercial Building in Garden Grove\")\n![Project View in Garden Grove](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project View in Garden Grove\")\n![Project Entrance in Garden Grove](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Garden Grove\")\n![Project Entrance in Garden Grove](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Garden Grove\")\n![Project Entrance in Garden Grove](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Garden Grove\")\n![Project Entrance in Garden Grove](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Garden Grove\")\n![Parking Area in Garden Grove](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Parking Area in Garden Grove\")\n![Project Entrance in Garden Grove](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Garden Grove\")\n![Project Entrance in Garden Grove](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Garden Grove\")\n![Project Entrance in Garden Grove](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Garden Grove\")\n![View from Gate in Garden Grove](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"View from Gate in Garden Grove\")\n![Project Entrance in Garden Grove](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Garden Grove\")\n![Parking Area in Garden Grove](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Parking Area in Garden Grove\")\n![Project Entrance in Garden Grove](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Project Entrance in Garden Grove\")\n![Garden Grove photos 2](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Garden Grove photos 2\")\n![Garden Grove photos 3](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Garden Grove photos 3\")\n![Garden Grove photos 4](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Garden Grove photos 4\")\n![Garden Grove photos 5](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Garden Grove photos 5\")\n![Garden Grove photos 6](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Garden Grove photos 6\")\n![Garden Grove photos 7](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Garden Grove photos 7\")\n![Garden Grove photos 8](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Garden Grove photos 8\")\n![Garden Grove photos 9](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Garden Grove photos 9\")\n![Garden Grove photos 10](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Garden Grove photos 10\")\n\n## About [Borivali West](https://www.magicbricks.com/Borivali-West-in-Mumbai-Overview)\n\n![Borivali West Video](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Borivali West Video\")\n\n## About Kamla Landmarc Group\n\n![Kamla Landmarc Group](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kamla Landmarc Group\")\n\n|  |\n| --- |\n| Kamla Lnadmarc, as it name suggest, was formed in 1974 with the sole purpose of creating in everything we set out to do. For us, the first and foremost objective towards reaching this milestone is Customer Value. We keep our customers at the Forefront of anything we do as we strive to remain an integral part of our customer's lives. We would live to make our presence felt every step of the way right from our customers' home to the office.    This customer obsessed ideology is the key driver in creating our business model which is built on ethical grounds and goes much beyond just construction. It has helped us to nurture dream, create lasting value and reach milestone time and again. And we make it all happen with a policy we call Virtue Connect. Virtue Connect is an exclusive system developed by Kamla Landmarc's Management that allow us to choose the best in terms of man Power,location, raw material etc. It makes for an efficient managerial system that permits inter connectivity amongst all facets which helps to gain swift work efficiency and strict quality filters.    With such sharp focus on quality management, we have effortlessly raised prime residential complexes, business hubs, malls, multiplexes and entertainment plazas. Our Dedicated team of architects, designers and engineers from all over the world has made our presence felt across Mumbai by conceiving such prestigious projects offering value of a lifetime. |\n\n![Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner\")\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n![H Rishabraj  Samaj Darshan photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"H Rishabraj  Samaj Darshan photo\")\n![Modispaces Ganges  photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Modispaces Ganges  photo\")\n![Romell Serene photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Romell Serene photo\")\n![Arkade Crown photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Arkade Crown photo\")\n![Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shivoham Avyukta Neelkamal photo\")\n![Amar Parul Kunj photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Amar Parul Kunj photo\")\n![Mehta Premeire photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mehta Premeire photo\")\n![Nicco Vanashri photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Nicco Vanashri photo\")\n![Lodha Altus photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Lodha Altus photo\")\n\n## Other Projects by Kamla Landmarc Group\n\n![Sai Jai Bhavani photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Sai Jai Bhavani photo\")\n![Grandeur photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Grandeur photo\")\n![Visawa Nivas photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Visawa Nivas photo\")\n![Kamla Tirthal photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kamla Tirthal photo\")\n![No image available](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"No image available\")\n![White Orchid photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"White Orchid photo\")\n![White Field photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"White Field photo\")\n\n## FAQs about Garden Grove\n\n### What are other residential projects near Garden Grove?\n\n### What is the address of Garden Grove?\n\n### Where can I download the brochure PDF of Garden Grove from?\n\n### Which is nearest metro station to Garden Grove?\n\n### How many towers in Garden Grove?\n\n### How many units are in Garden Grove?\n\n### How many flats are available for sale in Garden Grove on Magicbricks?\n\n### What is the area pin code of Garden Grove?\n\n### Which is nearest bus stop to Garden Grove?\n\n### What is the total area of Garden Grove?\n\n![Mumbai Metro Line 3 Route Map, Stations, & Opening Status | Aqua Line Metro Mumbai](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mumbai Metro Line 3 Route Map, Stations, & Opening Status | Aqua Line Metro Mumbai\")\n![Mumbai Metro 2026: Route, Map, Stations List, Lines, News](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mumbai Metro 2026: Route, Map, Stations List, Lines, News\")\n![Salman Khan House in Galaxy Apartments Bandra - Mumbai](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Salman Khan House in Galaxy Apartments Bandra - Mumbai\")\n![Harbour Line Mumbai Stations - Route, Map, Timings, Fare & More](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Harbour Line Mumbai Stations - Route, Map, Timings, Fare & More\")\n![Central Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Station, Timings, Fare & More](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Central Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Station, Timings, Fare & More\")\n![Mumbai Versova Ghatkopar Metro Route: Map, Stations & More | Mumbai Line 1 - Blue Line](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mumbai Versova Ghatkopar Metro Route: Map, Stations & More | Mumbai Line 1 - Blue Line\")\n![Yellow Line Metro Route of Mumbai | Line 2A & Line 2B](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Yellow Line Metro Route of Mumbai | Line 2A & Line 2B\")\n![Western Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Stations, Facilities, Fare & More](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Western Line Mumbai - Route, Map, Stations, Facilities, Fare & More\")\n![Mumbai vs Bengaluru vs Delhi-NCR: Where Should HNIs Invest in Luxury Property?](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mumbai vs Bengaluru vs Delhi-NCR: Where Should HNIs Invest in Luxury Property?\")\n![Ready Reckoner Rates in Mumbai 2026-27](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Ready Reckoner Rates in Mumbai 2026-27\")\n![Mumbai Ahmedabad Bullet Train Project: Opening Date, Facts, Route and Development Schedule](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mumbai Ahmedabad Bullet Train Project: Opening Date, Facts, Route and Development Schedule\")\n![Mumbai MHADA Lottery 2026: Application Process, Payment Details & Eligibility](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Mumbai MHADA Lottery 2026: Application Process, Payment Details & Eligibility\")\n![The Rise of Mira Bhayandar as a Premium Micro-Market in the Mumbai Metropolitan Region](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"The Rise of Mira Bhayandar as a Premium Micro-Market in the Mumbai Metropolitan Region\")\n![Bhumi Pednekar House in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth and More](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Bhumi Pednekar House in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth and More\")\n![Asalpha Metro Station on Mumbai Blue Line - Everything You Need to Know](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Asalpha Metro Station on Mumbai Blue Line - Everything You Need to Know\")\n![John Abraham house in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth & More](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"John Abraham house in Mumbai - Inside view, Images, Net Worth & More\")","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/adarsh-garden-grove/212011/project","title":"Adarsh Garden Grove, Borivali West, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹1.80 Cr Onwards | 1, 2, 3 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Adarsh Enterprises developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/adarsh-enterprises-17125-4050.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Adarsh Garden Grove Borivali West, Mumbai\n\n**₹1.80 Cr - 3.26 Cr**\n\n₹29,150 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why you should consider Adarsh Garden Grove?\n\n## About Adarsh Garden Grove, Borivali West by Adarsh Enterprises\n\nIntroducing Adarsh Garden Grove, a luxury residential project located in the heart of Borivali West. With its strategic location, the project offers endless connectivity options to major road networks. In close proximity to New Link Road, Swami Vivekanand Road, Dattapada Road, and the Western Express Highway, residents can easily access the city s major hubs, educational institutions, and employment centers. The project is also accredited with RERA certification (P51800048361).\n\nThis project offers a range of luxurious 1 BHK, 2 BHK, and 3 BHK apartments, designed to provide a perfect blend of comfort and style. Each apartment features premium specifications, including oil-bound distemper walls in the master bedroom. Residents can also enjoy a range of amenities, including power backup and kids play areas/sand pits, making living at Adarsh Garden Grove a truly unique experience.\n\nInvest in Adarsh Garden Grove and experience the perfect blend of luxury, comfort, and convenience. With its prime location, premium specifications, and range of amenities, this project is an ideal choice for those seeking a peaceful yet connected living experience. So, take a step closer to making your dream home a reality!\n\nThe following table outlines the available unit options at Adarsh Garden Grove:\n\n|  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Unit Type | Area (Sq. Ft.) | Price (Rs.) |\n| 1 BHK Apartment | 618 | 1.51 Cr |\n| 2 BHK Apartment | 785 | 1.91 Cr |\n| 2 BHK Apartment | 867 | 2.11 Cr |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 1103 | 2.69 Cr |\n| 3 BHK Apartment | 1116 | 2.72 Cr |\n\nThe residential property is strategically located near several notable landmarks, providing residents with easy access to essential amenities and services. These landmarks not only enhance the quality of life for residents but also offer a unique blend of convenience and comfort.\n\n## Adarsh Garden Grove Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Adarsh Garden Grove.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK Apartment  618 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.80 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  785 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.29 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  867 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.53 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1103 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 3.22 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  1116 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 3.26 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nAdarsh Garden Grove's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Borivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Adarsh Garden Grove | Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 29150 | 30900 |\n| Mar 2026 | 24350 | 31300 |\n| Dec 2025 | 24400 | 30300 |\n| Sep 2025 | 23300 | 30350 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nAdarsh Garden Grove avg. price is ₹ 29.1 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Borivali West at ₹ 30.9 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Oberoi Sky City Tower E](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/oberoi-sky-city-tower-e/100145/project \"Oberoi Sky City Tower E\") | ₹ 45,200 |\n| [Ruparel Mumbai XL](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/ruparel-mumbai-xl/111437/project \"Ruparel Mumbai XL\") | ₹ 34,600 |\n| Borivali West | ₹ 30,900 |\n| [Kabra Garnet](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/kabra-garnet/232955/project \"Kabra Garnet\") | ₹ 30,500 |\n| Current Project **Adarsh Garden Grove** | ₹ 29,150 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Borivali West ranges from ₹ 22.1 K to ₹ 74.4 K with options available for STUDIO,1,2,3 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Adarsh Garden Grove | In Borivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 32.7 K |\n| 2 BHK | - | ₹ 45.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 74.4 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Adarsh Garden Grove.\n\nA total of 8 residential transactions has been registered so far for Adarsh Garden Grove, amounting to ₹ 16 Cr till September 2026.\n\n#### MMRDA Plans Two New Ring Roads to Ease Mumbai Traffic\n\nThe Mumbai Metropolitan Region Development Authority (MMRDA) is planning two additional ring routes, expanding its proposed network from seven to nine. These new corridors will cover approximately 307 km and will connect existing roads and planned projects across Mumbai, Thane, and Navi Mumbai.\n\n#### Thane Infrastructure and Development Updates\n\nThe Thane-Borivali Twin Tunnel project saw the launch of TBM Arjuna on August 13, 2026, aiming to reduce travel time between Thane and Borivali to approximately 15 minutes. Amazon Data Services is developing a large data center in Ambernath, with an estimated construction cost of ₹3,500 crore, to be ready by 2029\n\n#### Mumbai Boosts Connectivity with Santacruz - Chembur link road Phase 2 & Chembur Metro Station\n\nCM Devendra Fadnavis inaugurated Phase 2 of the Santacruz-Chembur Link Road (SCLR) & the Chembur Metro Station under Metro Line 2B,The SCLR Phase 2 is expected to strengthen the road network between Mumbai's western and eastern suburbs, improving east-west connectivity.\n\n#### Thane-Borivali Twin Tunnel Project: Traffic Diversions Announced in Kasarvadavali\n\nTemporary traffic diversions have been implemented in Kasarvadavali for the ongoing work on the ambitious Thane-Borivali twin tunnel project by the Mumbai Metropolitan Region Development Authority (MMRDA). Certain routes will be closed from July 6 to August 5, 2026, to facilitate construction.\n\n#### Mumbai Monorail Services to Resume After Nine-Month Hiatus\n\nMumbai's monorail services are set to resume soon after a nine-month suspension, following approval from the Maharashtra government for safety improvements and fare revisions. MMRDA has proposed increased ticket prices. The monorail, which previously carried around 18,000 passengers daily, will offer improved services after safety upgrades.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Adarsh Garden Grove moved from ₹ 24,350/sqft to ₹ 29,150/sqft, reflecting a 19.71% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n### Govt. Registrations\n\n8 Sales Transactions Registered in Adarsh Garden Grove From Oct 25 to Sep 26 at Avg. Price ₹ 16.2 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Sales Transactions | Gross Sales Value | Registered Rate |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 8 | ₹ 16 Cr | ₹ 16,250 / Sq. Ft. |\n\nTransaction Period Oct 25 to Sep 26\n\n## Adarsh Garden Grove Floor Plans\n\n![Representative image for Floor plan of 1 