t-image/hirani-ruby-chs-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n1, 2 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.15 Cr to 1.65 Cr\n\n![Ashutosh Apartment Vazira residential project in Vazira](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/ashutosh-apartment-vazira-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nVazira, Mumbai\n\n1 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Chaitanya Radha Madhav residential project in Borivali East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/chaitanya-radha-madhav-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nBorivali East, Mumbai\n\n2, 3 BHK Apartment\n\n₹ 1.22 Cr to 1.90 Cr\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions About Adarsh Garden Grove\n\n### What are the unit options available in Adarsh Garden Grove?\n\nThe project offers a range of 1 BHK, 2 BHK, and 3 BHK apartments, with sizes starting from 618 Sq. Ft. to 1116 Sq. Ft.\n\n### What are the connectivity options available near Adarsh Garden Grove?\n\nThe project is well-connected to major roads, including New Link Road, Swami Vivekanand Road, Dattapada Road, and Western Express Highway, ensuring easy access to various parts of the city.\n\n### What is the pricing range for units in Adarsh Garden Grove?\n\nThe prices for units in Adarsh Garden Grove start from 1.51 Cr for a 1 BHK apartment and go up to 2.72 Cr for a 3 BHK apartment.\n\n### What are the amenities offered in Adarsh Garden Grove?\n\nThe project features a range of amenities, including 24 x 7 security, indoor games, normal park, and kids play areas, among others, to ensure a comfortable and enjoyable living experience.\n\n### Is Adarsh Garden Grove RERA-registered?\n\nYes, Adarsh Garden Grove is registered under the Rera number P51800048361, ensuring transparency and accountability in the project.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.nobroker.in/2bhk-flats-for-sale-in-kamala-garden-grove-complex-chikoowadi-mumbai-prjtl","title":"2 BHK flats for sale in Chikoowadi MumbaiFlats & Apartments for Sale in Kamala Garden Grove Complex, Chikoowadi, Mumbai | NoBroker","raw_content":"![logo](https://assets.nobroker.in/static/img/logos/nb_logo_new_trans.svg)\n![rent](https://assets.nobroker.in/nb-new/public/payrent.png)\n![shortlist](https://assets.nobroker.in/nb-new/public/shortlistNotification.svg)\n![hamburger](https://assets.nobroker.in/nb-new/public/hamburger-menu.svg)\n![list-icon](https://assets.nobroker.in/nb-new/public/BuilderProjectsListPage/listIconWhite.svg)\n![map-icon](https://assets.nobroker.in/nb-new/public/BuilderProjectsListPage/mapIcon.svg)\n\n# 396 - 2 BHK Flats for Sale in Kamala Garden Grove Complex, Chikoowadi, Mumbai | NoBroker\n\n## [2 BHK Apartment In Dimples Group 73 East For Sale In Kandivali West](/property/buy/2-bhk-apartment-for-sale-in-kandivali-west-mumbai/8a9fa6838bf62087018bf6596d4a1ff0/detail)\n\n![location](https://assets.nobroker.in/nb-new/public/List-Page/list_location_icon.png)\n![report abuse](https://assets.nobroker.in/nb-new/public/List-Page/abuseReportHollow.svg)\n![report abuse active](/nb-new/nb-new/primaryFlag.3fb868ea.svg)\n![2 BHK Flat In Dimples Group 73 East For Sale  In Kandivali West](https://images.nobroker.in/images/8a9fa6838bf62087018bf6596d4a1ff0/8a9fa6838bf62087018bf6596d4a1ff0_45366_573771_medium.jpg)\n![2 BHK Flat In Dimples Group 73 East For Sale  In Kandivali West](https://images.nobroker.in/images/8a9fa6838bf62087018bf6596d4a1ff0/8a9fa6838bf62087018bf6596d4a1ff0_45366_573771_medium.jpg)\n\n## [2 BHK Apartment In V Raheja La Serena For Sale In Kandivali West](/property/buy/2-bhk-apartment-for-sale-in-kandivali-west-mumbai/8a9f88838db4d7bf018db606118068de/